{"content":"{\n  \"chapter_contract_id\": \"contract:v2-n-10-1-1:v2\",\n  \"node_id\": \"v2_n_10_1_1\",\n  \"schema_version\": \"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\n  \"known_evidence_ids\": [],\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"block_id\": \"v2_n_10_1_1_p001\",\n      \"text\": \"本章规定本Ⅱ期慢性鼻窦炎伴鼻息肉研究中不良事件和严重不良事件的定义、严重程度、相关性判断、收集、记录、随访及报告要求。以下内容用于分别界定不良事件（AE）与治疗期出现的不良事件（TEAE）的定义、观察期、派生及术语绑定基础。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"block_id\": \"v2_n_10_1_1_p002\",\n      \"text\": \"不良事件（AE）指受试者在接受试验用药品后出现的任何不良医学事件，包括症状、体征、疾病、实验室检查异常等，不一定与试验用药品存在因果关系。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"block_id\": \"v2_n_10_1_1_p003\",\n      \"text\": \"AE 的收集与 TEAE 观察期自首次给予试验用药品开始，至末次给药后30天结束；在此期间新发生或恶化的 AE 归为 TEAE。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"block_id\": \"v2_n_10_1_1_p004\",\n      \"text\": \"治疗期出现的不良事件（TEAE）定义为首次给予试验用药品后新发生或较基线恶化的 AE；首次给药前已存在且未恶化的事件不计为 TEAE。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"block_id\": \"v2_n_10_1_1_p005\",\n      \"text\": \"既存疾病或症状应在筛选期病史中记录；若在首次给药后新发生或较基线加重，应作为 AE 记录；若持续存在但未加重，不作为 AE。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"block_id\": \"v2_n_10_1_1_p006\",\n      \"text\": \"不良事件名称应采用医学术语，使用 MedDRA 进行编码；以首选语（PT）作为事件名称，系统器官分类（SOC）用于汇总分析。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"block_id\": \"v2_n_10_1_1_p007\",\n      \"text\": \"本研究为慢性鼻窦炎伴鼻息肉研究，不属于肿瘤适应症，肿瘤进展例外不适用；因此，不应在本研究 AE/TEAE 定义、收集或归类中引入肿瘤进展例外规则。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}","receipt":{"idempotency_key":"chapter-draft.generate.v1","input_artifacts":[{"ref":"chapter-intake","sha256":"285de980adf3ca3b526d2a8b84d6dc1e6a5d319f55ca5b1fa5bbb5ba915d1aaf"}],"logical_call_id":"call:chapter-draft:6ef1032c6663467a605c53f8eac6fba424c15ef533ebbf896b20b5619aa07d3d:chapter-generate","node_execution_contract_id":"nec:chapter-draft:6ef1032c6663467a605c53f8eac6fba424c15ef533ebbf896b20b5619aa07d3d:chapter-generate","observed_model":"deepseek-flash","observed_provider":"deepseek","output_schema_ref":"https://protocol-v3.local/schemas/ordered-chapter-draft-candidate.v1.json","output_sha256":"2e308dd4acf54274b76d821ccb423085c80b79d147034e5bb6d5894a69afd484","prompt_sha256":"47dd66c834319411962b91127cd952207cccdab4dee7068a9ab81409e5aefa1e","provider_session_id":"b0245de9-5b3f-4078-85a4-36adac703061","requested_reasoning_effort":"max"},"schema":"model_response.v1"}